  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Migration Governance for Sustainable Development in Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the joint programme implemented by IOM, UN Women, and UNDP is to enhance migration governance in Indonesia by supporting the Government of Indonesia&#x2019;s capacities in evidence-based migration management, with the appropriate gender responsiveness, at the national and sub-national levels as well as to support improved cooperation at the global level.</narrative>
  </description>
